cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the master's thesis it accompanies (preferred-citation)."
type: software
title: "long-range-ml-potential: Machine Learning Potentials with Long Range Interaction"
abstract: >-
  Code of the master's thesis "Machine Learning Potentials with Long Range
  Interaction": a neural network potential that combines a local
  DeepPot-SE-style descriptor with a grid-based long-range term built from the
  centres of mass and element counts of grid cells.
